<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Dami Saldi Speciali | Le migliori offerte del web</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #ff3838;
            --dark: #1e272e;
            --light: #f5f6fa;
            --text: #2f3640;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--light);
            color: var(--text);
        }

        /* Header */
        header {
            background-color: var(--dark);
            color: white;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: white;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 1.5rem;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,0.6), rgba(0,0,0,0.6)), url('https://unsplash.com') no-repeat center center/cover;
            height: 400px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
            padding: 0 1rem;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        /* Sezione Offerte */
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 3rem auto;
            padding: 0 1rem;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .section-title::after {
            content: '';
            display: block;
            width: 50px;
            height: 5px;
            background-color: var(--primary);
            margin: 10px auto 0;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .offers-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        /* Card Prodotto */
        .card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            transition: transform 0.3s;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }

        .card-img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .card-content {
            padding: 1.5rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            flex-grow: 1;
        }

        .badge {
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            align-self: flex-start;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .card-title {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .prices {
            margin: 1rem 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .old-price {
            text-decoration: line-through;
            color: #888;
        }

        .new-price {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        .btn {
            display: block;
            text-align: center;
            background-color: var(--dark);
            color: white;
            padding: 0.8rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin-top: auto;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--primary);
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background-color: var(--dark);
            color: #888;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-top: 4rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="logo">Dami <span>Saldi Speciali</span></div>
        <nav>
            <a href="#">Home</a>
            <a href="#">Tecnologia</a>
            <a href="#">Moda</a>
            <a href="#">Contatti</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <h1>Sconti Folli Selezionati per Te</h1>
        <p>Ogni giorno le migliori occasioni del web in un unico posto.</p>
    </section>

    <main class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Le Offerte del Momento</h2>
        
        <div class="offers-grid">
            <!-- Prodotto 1 -->
            <div class="card">
                <img src="https://unsplash.com" alt="Cuffie" class="card-img">
                <div class="card-content">
                    <span class="badge">-40% SCONTO</span>
                    <h3 class="card-title">Cuffie Wireless Premium</h3>
                    <div class="prices">
                        <span class="old-price">129€</span>
                        <span class="new-price">79€</span>
                    </div>
                    <a href="#" class="btn">Vedi Offerta</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Prodotto 2 -->
            <div class="card">
                <img src="https://unsplash.com" alt="Orologio" class="card-img">
                <div class="card-content">
                    <span class="badge">-50% METÀ PREZZO</span>
                    <h3 class="card-title">Orologio Minimal Minimalist</h3>
                    <div class="prices">
                        <span class="old-price">199€</span>
                        <span class="new-price">99€</span>
                    </div>
                    <a href="#" class="btn">Vedi Offerta</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Prodotto 3 -->
            <div class="card">
                <img src="https://unsplash.com" alt="Scarpe" class="card-img">
                <div class="card-content">
                    <span class="badge">SUPER PROMO</span>
                    <h3 class="card-title">Scarpe Sportive Running</h3>
                    <div class="prices">
                        <span class="old-price">90€</span>
                        <span class="new-price">45€</span>
                    </div>
                    <a href="#" class="btn">Vedi Offerta</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Dami Saldi Speciali. Tutti i diritti riservati.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>

